{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "Forkray"}, "description": {"en-US": "Forkray, a fork of v2rayNG, compiled from source on GitHub Actions. Every release publishes a build manifest with the exact sources, toolchain and checksums, so it can be rebuilt and compared. Source: https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "905b4869b0a06327082135f65b8c64f0fa811b4a6f881848425adba73b93064d", "size": 8489}}, "address": "https://acidefluorhydrique.github.io/v2rayNG/repo", "mirrors": [{"isPrimary": true, "url": "https://acidefluorhydrique.github.io/v2rayNG/repo"}, {"url": "https://lanticy.codeberg.page/forkray-fdroid/fdroid/repo", "countryCode": "DE"}, {"url": "https://ray.arielx.is-a.dev/fdroid/repo", "countryCode": "DE"}, {"url": "https://hydrofluoricacid.gitlab.io/forkray-fdroid/fdroid/repo", "countryCode": "US"}, {"url": "https://gitlab.com/HydrofluoricAcid/forkray-fdroid/-/raw/pages/fdroid/repo"}, {"url": "https://lanticy.itcouldbewor.se/forkray-fdroid/fdroid/repo", "countryCode": "US"}, {"url": "https://0xacab.org/lanticy/forkray-fdroid/-/raw/pages/fdroid/repo", "countryCode": "US"}, {"url": "https://forkray.is-my.app/fdroid/repo"}], "timestamp": 1794644441000, "categories": {"Internet": {"name": {"en-US": "Internet"}}}}, "packages": {"io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng": {"metadata": {"added": 1794644437000, "categories": ["Internet"], "changelog": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/releases", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/issues", "lastUpdated": 1794644440000, "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG", "featureGraphic": {"en-US": {"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/featureGraphic_8IPavUGHfo1TZJe21NBtSDMiVgpOLKVfKz2BvuSTN3U=.png", "sha256": "f083dabd41877e8d536497b6d4d06d483322560a4e2ca55f2b3d81bee4933775", "size": 5180}}, "screenshots": {"phone": {"en-US": [{"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/phoneScreenshots/1.jpg", "sha256": "644f8849e7b7188305b9625625710c3839079b085d1b7654854e82c7e22c9ca0", "size": 153212}, {"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/phoneScreenshots/2.jpg", "sha256": "fad3d3482fe79c87fcb7cbe65b0d976ea13d8ca6bb9c2aaaa521629dab21c2d2", "size": 101632}, {"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/phoneScreenshots/3.jpg", "sha256": "c0e8f037460208d8862bdb9ac72f00ad9aae0e438da4a18d79bf6dd496109b12", "size": 127814}, {"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/phoneScreenshots/4.jpg", "sha256": "8d377e3016a95887494abcefe70a2f02ee1c7ed923b188298e128639dcbe46d8", "size": 109444}, {"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/phoneScreenshots/5.jpg", "sha256": "72ba792da5337041d72a70ff8a854f372415753c0d199c865f6463567db0be56", "size": 133704}]}}, "authorName": "AcideFluorhydrique (fork of v2rayNG by 2dust)", "name": {"en-US": "Forkray", "zh-CN": "Forkray", "zh-TW": "Forkray"}, "summary": {"en-US": "A V2Ray client for Android, forked from v2rayNG and built from source", "zh-CN": "Android 上的 V2Ray 客户端，分支自 v2rayNG，从源代码构建", "zh-TW": "Android 上的 V2Ray 用戶端，分支自 v2rayNG，從原始碼建置"}, "description": {"en-US": "Forkray is a fork of <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a>, the V2Ray client for Android, supporting <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray core</a>. It follows every upstream v2rayNG release and keeps its features and settings.\n\n<b>How it differs from v2rayNG</b><ul><li>Built entirely from source on public CI, including the Xray core, which upstream downloads as a prebuilt library. Every release publishes the exact sources, toolchain and checksums used, so it can be rebuilt and compared byte for byte.</li><li>Its own application ID, so it installs alongside v2rayNG rather than replacing it.</li><li>No in-app update check (your F-Droid client handles updates) and no promotion link.</li><li>Never switches to a direct connection silently. v2rayNG fetches subscriptions and other data directly, from your real IP address, whenever the proxy fails, even in the background. Forkray skips background updates while disconnected, tells you when it has to connect directly, and asks before retrying without the proxy.</li><li>Routing databases built from freely licensed sources in <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/forkray-geodata\">forkray-geodata</a>, instead of prebuilt downloads.</li></ul>\n<b>Geoip and Geosite</b><ul><li>The bundled geoip.dat and geosite.dat come from v2fly/domain-list-community, gfwlist, china-operator-ip, DB-IP Lite and the address ranges operators publish. IP Geolocation by <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\">DB-IP</a>.</li><li>They are in <tt>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</tt> (the path may differ on some devices).</li><li>The download feature fetches the larger lists from <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a> instead, through your proxy when it is running.</li></ul>\nSource code and issues: <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>. Documentation for the shared features: the <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>.\n", "zh-CN": "Forkray 是 <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a> 的分支。v2rayNG 是 Android 上的 V2Ray 客户端，支持 <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray 内核</a>。Forkray 跟进上游 v2rayNG 的每一个版本，保留其全部功能和设置。\n\n<b>与 v2rayNG 的区别</b><ul><li>全部在公开的 CI 上从源代码构建，包括上游以预编译库形式下载的 Xray 内核。每个版本都会公布所用的确切源代码、工具链和校验和，任何人都可以重新构建并逐字节比对。</li><li>使用独立的应用 ID，可以与 v2rayNG 同时安装，不会替换它。</li><li>没有应用内更新检查（由 F-Droid 客户端负责更新），也没有推广链接。</li><li>绝不悄悄改为直连。代理失败时，v2rayNG 会直接用你的真实 IP 获取订阅等数据，即使在后台也是如此。Forkray 在未连接时跳过后台更新，需要直连时会告诉你，并在不经代理重试之前先征求你的同意。</li><li>路由数据库由 <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/forkray-geodata\">forkray-geodata</a> 中采用自由许可的来源构建，而不是下载预编译文件。</li></ul>\n<b>Geoip 与 Geosite</b><ul><li>内置的 geoip.dat 和 geosite.dat 来自 v2fly/domain-list-community、gfwlist、china-operator-ip、DB-IP Lite 以及各运营商公布的地址段。IP Geolocation by <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\">DB-IP</a>.</li><li>它们位于 <tt>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</tt>（部分设备上路径可能不同）。</li><li>下载功能会改从 <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a> 获取更大的规则列表；代理运行时经由代理下载。</li></ul>\n源代码与问题反馈：<a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>。共有功能的文档请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>。\n", "zh-TW": "Forkray 是 <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a> 的分支。v2rayNG 是 Android 上的 V2Ray 用戶端，支援 <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray 核心</a>。Forkray 跟進上游 v2rayNG 的每一個版本，保留其所有功能與設定。\n\n<b>與 v2rayNG 的差異</b><ul><li>完全在公開的 CI 上從原始碼建置，包括上游以預先編譯的程式庫形式下載的 Xray 核心。每個版本都會公開所用的確切原始碼、工具鏈與校驗碼，任何人都能重新建置並逐位元組比對。</li><li>使用獨立的應用程式 ID，可與 v2rayNG 同時安裝，不會取代它。</li><li>沒有應用程式內的更新檢查（由 F-Droid 用戶端負責更新），也沒有推廣連結。</li><li>絕不默默改為直接連線。代理失敗時，v2rayNG 會直接以你的真實 IP 取得訂閱等資料，即使在背景也是如此。Forkray 在未連線時略過背景更新，需要直接連線時會告訴你，並在不經代理重試之前先徵求你的同意。</li><li>路由資料庫由 <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/forkray-geodata\">forkray-geodata</a> 中採用自由授權的來源建置，而非下載預先編譯的檔案。</li></ul>\n<b>Geoip 與 Geosite</b><ul><li>內建的 geoip.dat 與 geosite.dat 來自 v2fly/domain-list-community、gfwlist、china-operator-ip、DB-IP Lite 以及各電信業者公布的位址範圍。IP Geolocation by <a href=\"https://db-ip.com\">DB-IP</a>.</li><li>它們位於 <tt>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</tt>（部分裝置上的路徑可能不同）。</li><li>下載功能會改從 <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a> 取得較大的規則清單；代理執行時會透過代理下載。</li></ul>\n原始碼與問題回報：<a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>。共用功能的說明文件請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>。\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/en-US/icon_kFtIabCgYycIITX2W4xk8PqBG0pviBhIQlrbpzuTBk0=.png", "sha256": "905b4869b0a06327082135f65b8c64f0fa811b4a6f881848425adba73b93064d", "size": 8489}}, "preferredSigner": "561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9"}, "versions": {"01de85976267a9d789edd061aef8918ff0119bd4349457d14394f541dd484d2b": {"added": 1794644440000, "file": {"name": "/v2rayNG_2.3.15-fdroid_x86_64.apk", "sha256": "01de85976267a9d789edd061aef8918ff0119bd4349457d14394f541dd484d2b", "size": 22491695}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "2.3.15", "versionCode": 5075504, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 37}, "signer": {"sha256": ["561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}, "a114f05614d73cd6d41b54413230848372248025e4aba66603c352a1018377ea": {"added": 1794644439000, "file": {"name": "/v2rayNG_2.3.15-fdroid_x86.apk", "sha256": "a114f05614d73cd6d41b54413230848372248025e4aba66603c352a1018377ea", "size": 23008990}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86"], "versionName": "2.3.15", "versionCode": 5075503, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 37}, "signer": {"sha256": ["561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": 